# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Claude Code. agents/ and skills/ ARE tracked: they carry standing
# instructions that enter every session, and until now no reviewing
# role - owner, red team, git log, any diff - could see them.
# settings.local.json stays out: per-machine trust, absolute paths,
# a dev credential. MEASURED: this must be `.claude/*`, never
# `.claude/` - a negation under an ignored DIRECTORY is inert,
# because git never descends into it to read the negation.
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
# ...but the gate's own audit log is runtime data, not config. These two
# patterns come AFTER the negation on purpose: the last match wins.
.claude/hooks/*.log
.claude/hooks/*.log.1
